{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"西番雅书","commonName":"西番雅书","title":"西番雅书","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"fc1196cb65315a28a092f977ca923fa3326df17ab28ce5e53635179f429191aa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":51},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的败坏"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"这叛逆、污秽、充满压迫的城有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不听命令，不受管教；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不倚靠耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不亲近她的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的首领是咆哮的狮子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的审判官是夜间的豺狼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不留一点猎物到天明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的先知狂妄诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的祭司亵渎圣殿，违背律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但城中的耶和华是公义的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂绝不做不义之事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂每天早晨伸张正义，从不间断。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，不义之人却不知羞耻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“我已消灭列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毁他们的城楼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们的街道荒废，没有路人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的城邑沦为废墟，杳无人迹，没有居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以为这城一定会敬畏我，接受管教，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样我就不必照所定的毁灭她的居所。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，他们却更加热衷于犯罪作恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“因此，要等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候我起来指控的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已决定召集列国，汇聚列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向他们倾倒我的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的怒火必吞噬天下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的拯救"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“那时，我必洁净万民的口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们好求告我的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同心合意地事奉我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些敬拜我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我那些分散的子民必从古实河对岸带着供物来献给我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那天，你必不再因背叛我而羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为那时我必除掉你那里的狂傲之徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在我的圣山上必不再高傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把谦卑贫苦的人留在你那里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必投靠在耶和华的名下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的余民必不再作恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再撒谎，口中不再出诡诈之言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们吃喝躺卧，无人惊扰。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["欢乐之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"少女锡安啊，歌唱吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，欢呼吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女耶路撒冷啊，尽情地欢喜快乐吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已经撤销对你的刑罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赶走你的仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的王耶和华与你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不再惧怕灾祸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那天，耶路撒冷必听到这样的话：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“锡安啊，不要害怕！不要双手发软！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的上帝耶和华与你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是大能的拯救者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必因你而欢喜快乐，欢然歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用祂的爱安慰你。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"“我必招聚你那里因不能守节期而忧愁的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你不再蒙受羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，那时我必惩罚所有欺压你的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救瘸腿的，召回分散的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们在普天之下的羞辱化为赞美和尊荣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，我必招聚你们，带你们回到故土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们亲眼目睹我带你们回到故土后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使你们在天下万民中声名远扬，得享尊荣。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}